               <physMedium xml:id="physMedium_a6c3f9f3">Written in brown ink. Paper: 20 staves. Above the first stave: "Hilsen til Frænderne. Ingemanns Holger Danske. / 3<rend xml:id="idm34" rend="sup">die</rend> Udgave pag. 3." At the end of the music four additional bars above which Hartmann has written: "Efter at Soloen har sluttet 7<rend xml:id="idm35" rend="sup">de</rend> Vers, kan / Choret gjentage saaledes". End-dated: "D. 15 Mai 1848."</physMedium>
